type DshEnvironmentKey = `${typeof DSH_ENV_PREFIX}${string}`
```

```ts type-equiv
/** Trusted DeepSeek Harness variables for one child-process execution. */
type DshEnvironment = Readonly<Record<DshEnvironmentKey, string>>
```

